# Build context of deploy/Dockerfile (the repository root): only what Cargo
# needs to resolve the workspace and build lethora-server.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!vendor/
!app/src-tauri/

# Build output, generated and other files no build here reads.
**/target/
app/src-tauri/gen/
app/src-tauri/icons/
**/*.lethora/
**/*.log
